# Defeats the segment matcher so EVERY declared route is treated as matching any link of the same
# segment count, restoring the exact defect the verifier was written to close: a host whose nav
# label drifted from its route macro (`path: "/conversations"` mounted while `chat_path` still
# says `/chat`) passes the gate and ships a sidebar link that raises
# `Phoenix.Router.NoRouteError` on the user's first click. The coverage leg, the label scan and
# every host's own clean run stay intact, so a sabotage that broke the whole task would prove
